  "keywords": [
    "publisher-tested"
  ],
  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "2 cups milk",
    "8 large eggs",
    "3 stalks green onions, chopped",
    "1 teaspoon onion powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.75 pound Canadian bacon, cut into 1/2-inch dice",
    "6 English muffins, cut into 1/2-inch dice",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground paprika",
    "1 cup milk",
    "1 (.9 ounce) package Hollandaise sauce mix",
    "0.25 cup margarine"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/n3AWS1nTo5RqqiH7axazQD9m170=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221988-eggs-benedict-casserole-VAT-step-01-2e6570d99d254c0dae5135d5c1739880.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221988/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To prepare the casserole: Whisk milk, eggs, green onions, onion powder, and salt together in a large bowl until well combined. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gEygEy-YT1TVgEfFVecmqepkz2g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221988-eggs-benedict-casserole-VAT-step-02-571a6db7012d4437beeef1b7fe90007f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221988/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Layer 1/2 of the Canadian bacon in the prepared baking dish; cover with English muffins.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fYtr2Zisi7RH-3T99Gopb7ko2Ec=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221988-eggs-benedict-casserole-VAT-step-03-514327de3cff45209389487cd8634f82.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221988/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with remaining Canadian bacon and pour egg mixture over everything. Cover the baking dish with plastic wrap and refrigerate, 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/j8fHdZ88mn_vhV1Z0B4DAqnOOhg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221988-eggs-benedict-casserole-VAT-step-04-1-f1a15e0930574b1ba832667e6a667361.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221988/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Remove plastic wrap and sprinkle casserole with paprika; cover the baking dish with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m0Hj1Lwd9C0_yygZZhpUZRosUGo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221988-eggs-benedict-casserole-VAT-step-05-1covered-a437e13593964bb195d05ae3890248bb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221988/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until eggs are nearly set, about 30 minutes. Remove the foil and continue baking until eggs are completely set, about 15 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vm3fhNpKPlcrVzv3bzO8LHFIRYM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221988-eggs-benedict-casserole-VAT-step-06-54640b99ad7c4926961968501f3640e7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221988/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make the sauce: Whisk 1 cup milk and Hollandaise sauce mix in a saucepan over medium heat. Add butter; cook, stirring frequently, until boiling. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer, stirring constantly, until thickened, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sm33LYluH9yutdkT6wv1TxwkymA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221988-eggs-benedict-casserole-VAT-step-07-1stirringaction-4d2cdb93ed7a4a14be9c3f60925efa7e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221988/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve: Slice casserole into 10 pieces; transfer each piece onto a plate and drizzle warm sauce on top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-JBVp-6Z8gQnXay47ZrqH5W6rSI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221988-eggs-benedict-casserole-VAT-step-08-b5604c293547440f8b6682ad1c5c3050.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221988/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Th38ZrVomwOXno4vpYZ6Lhmyo8s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221988-eggs-benedict-casserole-VAT-4x3-platedportion-51fbb6e5996c4893b95d56aa013a81ff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221988/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
